/-!
# The table evaluations' templates (G:2224-2238)

`vtEvalData[k]`: evaluation `k`'s first statement, its value, its table's `τ_g` value; it is
`fs_next` at the cursor `σ 5932` (offset `k`), copied, stored to `claim_pool[5 + k]` with
`claim_cplen_g[5 + k] = τ_g`. `vtPermData[j]`: the permutation before evaluation `4(j + 1)`, its
first statement and its outputs' first value.
-/

